Package: file-organizer
Version: 2.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pyside6, python3-tk
Recommends: python3-matplotlib
Maintainer: Elshad Guliyev <ellshad.012@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ell-shad/file-organizer
Description: File Organizer - sort files by category
 A modern graphical tool to organize files into category folders
 (Images, Documents, Audio, …) with live preview, undo support,
 and a scriptable CLI.
 .
 v2.0 uses a resizable HiDPI-aware Qt interface (Tk fallback included)
 and never silently overwrites existing files.
